# Pi: the question tool is the vendored star_questionnaire, sub-agents go through
# star_subagent, the shell is bash and the reader is read. The dispatch paragraph
# supplies model in single/tasks/chain form instead of Claude's per-call clause.
AskUserQuestion	`star_questionnaire`
`Agent`	`star_subagent`
\bBash\b	`bash`
`Read`	`read`
CLAUDE\.md	AGENTS.md
CLAUDE	AGENTS
, `model:` the (?:READ|EXEC|PLAN) tier value the opening load returned, omitted when that key is empty	
、`model:` 取开场装载返回的 (?:READ|EXEC|PLAN) 档值，该键为空时不带这个参数	
; `model:` the EXEC tier value the opening load returned, the READ tier value for that read-only case, omitted when the key is empty	
；`model:` 取开场装载返回的 EXEC 档值，只读勘察那种情况取 READ 档值，键为空时不带这个参数	
, unless the EXEC tier value the opening load returned is non-empty, in which case it names that	
;开场装载返回的 EXEC 档值非空时改为指定那个值	
